{"page":435,"verses":[{"verse_key":"35:4","surah":35,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن يُكَذِّبُوكَ فَقَدْ كُذِّبَتْ رُسُلٌ مِّن قَبْلِكَ ۚ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they call you a liar [Prophet], many messengers before you were also called liars: it is to God that all things will be returned.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُكَذِّبُوكَ","en_gloss":"they deny you","transliteration":"yukadhibūka","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then certainly","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُذِّبَتْ","en_gloss":"were denied","transliteration":"kudhibat","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلٌۭ","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulun","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"tur'jaʿu","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_gloss":"the matters","transliteration":"l-umūru","verse_key":"35:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:4"}]},{"verse_key":"35:5","surah":35,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ إِنَّ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقٌّ ۖ فَلَا تَغُرَّنَّكُمُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَلَا يَغُرَّنَّكُم بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْغَرُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People! God’s promise is true, so do not let the present life deceive you. Do not let the Deceiver deceive you about God:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"35:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","