:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَٱتَّخِذُوهُ","en_gloss":"so take him","transliteration":"fa-ittakhidhūhu","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَدُوًّا ۚ","en_gloss":"(as) an enemy","transliteration":"ʿaduwwan","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"he invites","transliteration":"yadʿū","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حِزْبَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his party","transliteration":"ḥiz'bahu","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِيَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they may be","transliteration":"liyakūnū","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābi","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلسَّعِيرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Blaze","transliteration":"l-saʿīri","verse_key":"35:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:6"}]},{"verse_key":"35:7","surah":35,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُم مَّغْفِرَةٌ وَأَجْرٌ كَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who disbelieve will be punished severely; those who believe and do good deeds will be forgiven, and richly rewarded.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَدِيدٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdun","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratun","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَجْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a reward","transliteration":"wa-ajrun","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَبِيرٌ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"kabīrun","verse_key":"35:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:7"}]},{"verse_key":"35:8","surah":35,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَن زُيِّنَ لَهُۥ سُوٓءُ عَمَلِهِۦ فَرَءَاهُ حَسَنًا ۖ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُضِلُّ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ ۖ فَلَا تَذْهَبْ نَفْسُكَ عَلَيْهِمْ حَسَرَٰتٍ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِمَا يَصْنَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What about those whose evil deeds are made alluring to them so that they think they are good? God leaves whoever He will to stray and guides whoever He will. [Prophet], do not waste your soul away with regret for them: God knows exactly what they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"Then is (he) who ","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"زُيِّنَ","en_gloss":"is made fair-seeming","transliteration":"zuyyina","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُوٓءُ","en_gloss":"(the) evil","transliteration":"sūu","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَمَلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(of) his deed ","transliteration":"ʿamalihi","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَرَءَاهُ","en_gloss":"so that he sees it","transliteration":"faraāhu","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَسَنًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) good","transliteration":"ḥasanan","verse_key":"35:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss"