is God who sends forth the winds; they raise up the clouds; We drive them to a dead land and with them revive the earth after its death: such will be the Resurrection.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْسَلَ","en_gloss":"sends","transliteration":"arsala","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ","en_gloss":"the winds","transliteration":"l-riyāḥa","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَتُثِيرُ","en_gloss":"so that they raise","transliteration":"fatuthīru","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَحَابًۭا","en_gloss":"(the) clouds","transliteration":"saḥāban","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَسُقْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We drive them","transliteration":"fasuq'nāhu","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَلَدٍۢ","en_gloss":"a land","transliteration":"baladin","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّيِّتٍۢ","en_gloss":"dead","transliteration":"mayyitin","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَحْيَيْنَا","en_gloss":"and We revive","transliteration":"fa-aḥyaynā","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"therewith","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَوْتِهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its death","transliteration":"mawtihā","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلنُّشُورُ","en_gloss":"(will be) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-nushūru","verse_key":"35:9"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:9"}]},{"verse_key":"35:10","surah":35,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"مَن كَانَ يُرِيدُ ٱلْعِزَّةَ فَلِلَّهِ ٱلْعِزَّةُ جَمِيعًا ۚ إِلَيْهِ يَصْعَدُ ٱلْكَلِمُ ٱلطَّيِّبُ وَٱلْعَمَلُ ٱلصَّـٰلِحُ يَرْفَعُهُۥ ۚ وَٱلَّذِينَ يَمْكُرُونَ ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ ۖ وَمَكْرُ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُوَ يَبُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If anyone desires power, all power belongs to God; good words rise up to Him and He lifts up the righteous deed, but a severe torment awaits those who plot evil and their plotting will come to nothing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"[is] desires","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"[is] desires","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعِزَّةَ","en_gloss":"the honor","transliteration":"l-ʿizata","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"then for Allah","transliteration":"falillahi","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعِزَّةُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Honor","transliteration":"l-ʿizatu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَمِيعًا ۚ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"To Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَصْعَدُ","en_gloss":"ascends","transliteration":"yaṣʿadu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْكَلِمُ","en_gloss":"the words","transliteration":"l-kalimu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبُ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"l-ṭayibu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْعَمَلُ","en_gloss":"and the deed","transliteration":"wal-ʿamalu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحُ","en_gloss":"righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَرْفَعُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"raises it","transliteration":"yarfaʿuhu","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"35:10"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَمْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":